# Doc Ock's Tentacles' trigger is on the stack when Bot2 exiles Kokusho in response with Swords to Plowshares: the creature
# is gone when the ability resolves (CR 400.7, 701.3b), so Bot1 is asked nothing (`! Bot1.Accept`) and the Equipment
# stays unattached. The Swords is cast only after the trigger is on the stack (Bot2 passes with the Kokusho spell).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Doc Ock's Tentacles
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Swamp
Swamp x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Doc Ock's Tentacles.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kokusho, the Evening Star.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Kokusho, the Evening Star)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Kokusho, the Evening Star
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Doc Ock's Tentacles
